  "description": "T1 & T2 – Lime (Tilia sp.)\r\nCrown reduction by approximately 20–25% to reduce height and lateral spread,\r\nselective crown thinning to improve light penetration, and removal of any dead,\r\ndiseased or crossing branches.\r\n\r\nAll works to be carried out in accordance with BS3998:2010.\r\n\r\nThe proposed works are required to manage the size and spread of the trees, as the branches have become overextended within the garden setting.\r\nThe works will help maintain a balanced crown, improve light to the garden, and ensure the trees remain suitable for their residential context.\r\nThe proposals are minor in nature and will not adversely affect the health, appearance, or amenity value of the trees.",
